post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'

==> Absotui needs a one-time setup per user (skip what you already have):

      mkdir -p ~/.config/absotui
      cp -n /usr/share/absotui/config.example.toml ~/.config/absotui/config.toml
      [ -f ~/.config/absotui/.env ] || echo "ABSOTUI_SECRET_KEY=$(od -An -tx1 -N32 /dev/urandom | tr -d ' \n')" > ~/.config/absotui/.env

    The secret key only encrypts your saved login on your own disk. If you set
    XDG_CONFIG_HOME, use that folder instead of ~/.config.

==> Then run: absotui

    VLC is the default player. For mpv, install the mpv package and switch in
    Settings > Player.
    Update Absotui through pacman or your AUR helper, not its in-app updater.

MSG
}
